{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">2000 AMC 12 #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">2000 AMC 10 #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Fibonacci sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/f/83f469bc212a70ae496b919a9f309c8999736ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,1,2,3,5,8,13,21,\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" /> starts with two 1s, and each term afterwards is the sum of its two predecessors. Which one of the ten digits is the last to appear in the units position of a number in the Fibonacci sequence?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cfc00151dddb233ee7f900f011ac2dc665351e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ 0  \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\ 4  \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\ 6  \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\ 7  \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The units digit of any term after the second term can be found by summing the units digits of the previous two terms and taking the units digit of that sum (i.e. taking the sum of the previous two terms modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />).\n</p><p>The sequence of units digits therefore starts with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e18071d7ab8517a2789246eb190475309b7854f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,1,2,3,5,8,3,1,4,5,9,4,3,7,0,7,7,4,1,5,6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"352\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d1963cb01230734fed772d6578e003c559f9d7bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(C)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"32\" /> appears last.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4dWDOG31tQM?si=Ne3F969T10goxIjC\">https://youtu.be/4dWDOG31tQM?si=Ne3F969T10goxIjC</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HK9hhf9Vw68\">https://youtu.be/HK9hhf9Vw68</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YrAs8vadKMk?si=r-LFqv0zmSHSKszL&amp;t=184\">https://youtu.be/YrAs8vadKMk?si=r-LFqv0zmSHSKszL&amp;t=184</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><spa